{"id": "14-1179-2-6", "zh": "为什么说“**katākārehi**”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1179-7-14", "zh": "例如 tamhā、tamhi、imamhā、imamhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1180-2-9", "zh": "101,80. Suhisvakāro e（在 su、hi 之前，a 音变为 e）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1181-2-6", "zh": "在 su、hi 这两个语尾之前，a 音变为 e。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1182-2-37", "zh": "例如 sabbesu、yesu、tesu、kesu、purisesu、imesu、kusalesu、tumhesu、amhesu、sabbehi、yehi、tehi、kehi、purisehi、imehi、kusalehi、tumhehi、amhehi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1183-2-10", "zh": "102,202. Sabbanāmānaṃ naṃmhi ca（在 naṃ 之前，一切代词的 a 音也变为 e）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1184-2-9", "zh": "一切代词的词末 a 音，在 naṃ 语尾之前，也变为 e。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1185-2-29", "zh": "例如 sabbesaṃ、sabbesānaṃ、yesaṃ、yesānaṃ、tesaṃ、tesānaṃ、imesaṃ、imesānaṃ、kesaṃ、kesānaṃ、itaresaṃ、itaresānaṃ、katamesaṃ、katamesānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1185-30-33", "zh": "为什么说“sabbanāmānaṃ”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1185-34-37", "zh": "例如 buddhānaṃ bhagavantānaṃ āciṇṇasamāciṇṇo（这是诸佛世尊一贯奉行的惯例）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1186-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**akāro**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1186-6-9", "zh": "例如 amūsaṃ、amūsānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1187-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**naṃmhi**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1187-6-9", "zh": "例如 sabbe、ime。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1188-2-4", "zh": "规则中用 ca 字，是为了牵引上一条规则的内容。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1189-2-10", "zh": "103,79. Ato nena（在 a 之后，nā 变为 ena）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1190-2-10", "zh": "在这个 a 音之后，nā 语尾替换为 ena。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1191-2-15", "zh": "例如 sabbena、yena、tena、kena、anena、purisena、rūpena。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1192-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**ato**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1192-6-11", "zh": "例如 muninā、amunā、bhikkhunā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1193-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**nā**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1193-6-7", "zh": "例如 tasmā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1194-2-8", "zh": "104,66. So（在 a 之后，si 变为 o）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1195-2-10", "zh": "在这个 a 音之后，si 语尾替换为 o。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1196-2-13", "zh": "例如 sabbo、yo、so、ko、amuko、puriso。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1197-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**si**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1197-6-7", "zh": "例如 purisānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1198-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**ato**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1198-6-7", "zh": "例如 sayambhū。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1199-2-9", "zh": "105,0. So vā（在 a 之后，nā 可以变为 so）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1200-2-11", "zh": "在这个 a 音之后，nā 语尾可以替换为 so。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1201-2-17", "zh": "例如 atthaso dhammaṃ jānāti（依据意义了知法）、byañjanaso atthaṃ jānāti（依据文句了知意义）、akkharaso、suttaso、padaso、yasaso。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1201-18-25", "zh": "又如 upāyaso、sabbaso、thāmaso、ṭhānaso。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1202-2-6", "zh": "为什么说“**vā**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1202-7-25", "zh": "例如 pādena vā pādārahena vā atirekapādena vā yo bhikkhu theyyacittena parassa bhaṇḍaṃ gaṇhāti, so bhikkhu pārājiko hoti asaṃvāso（无论是一巴陀、值一巴陀还是超过一巴陀，凡是比丘以偷盗的心拿取他人的财物，这位比丘就犯了波罗夷，不得共住）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-1203-2-8", "zh": "106,313. Dīghorehi（在 dīgha、ora 之后，smā 可以变为 so）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1204-2-10", "zh": "在 dīgha、ora 这两个词之后，smā 语尾可以替换为 so。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1205-2-9", "zh": "例如 dīghaso、oraso、dīghamhā、oramhā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1206-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**dīghorehi**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1206-6-9", "zh": "例如 saramhā、vacanamhā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1207-2-8", "zh": "107,69. Sabbayonīnamāe（在 a 之后，所有的 yo 可以依次变为 ā、e）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1208-2-11", "zh": "在这个 a 音之后，所有的 yo 语尾可以依次替换为 ā 和 e。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1209-2-9", "zh": "例如 purisā、purise、rūpā、rūpe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1210-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**vā**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1210-6-11", "zh": "例如 aggayo、munayo、isayo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1211-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“yonīnaṃ”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1211-6-9", "zh": "例如 purisassa、rūpassa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1212-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**akārato**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1212-6-15", "zh": "例如 daṇḍino、aṭṭhīni、aggī pajjalanti（火燃烧）、munī caranti（牟尼们游行）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1213-2-8", "zh": "108,90. Smāsmiṃnaṃvā（在 a 之后，smā、smiṃ 可以依次变为 ā、e）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1214-2-14", "zh": "在这个 a 音之后，所有的 smā、smiṃ 语尾可以依次替换为 ā 和 e。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1215-2-10", "zh": "例如 purisā、purisasmā、purise、purisasmiṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1216-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**akārato**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1216-6-13", "zh": "例如 daṇḍinā、daṇḍismiṃ、bhikkhunā、bhikkhusmiṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1217-2-9", "zh": "109,304. Āya catutthekavacanassatu（在 a 之后，第四格单数语尾可以变为 āya）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1218-2-10", "zh": "在这个 a 音之后，第四格单数语尾可以替换为 āya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1219-2-9", "zh": "例如 atthāya hitāya sukhāya devamanussānaṃ buddho loke uppajjati（为了天人的利益、福祉与安乐，佛陀出现在世间）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1220-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**ato**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1220-6-7", "zh": "例如 isissa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1221-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**catutthī**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1221-6-8", "zh": "例如 purisassa mukhaṃ（人的脸）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1222-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**ekavacanassa**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1222-6-8", "zh": "例如 purisānaṃ dadāti（给众人）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1223-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**vā**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1223-6-12", "zh": "例如 dātā hoti samaṇassa vā brāhmaṇassa vā（他是布施给沙门或婆罗门的人）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1224-2-5", "zh": "由于规则中用了 tu 字，也可以变为 atthaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-1224-6-11", "zh": "例如 atthatthaṃ、hitatthaṃ、sukhatthaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1225-2-11", "zh": "110,201. Tayo neva ca sabbanāmehi（在代词之后，这三种替换都不发生）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1226-2-16", "zh": "在那些以 a 结尾的代词之后，smā、smiṃ、sa 这三个语尾都不替换为 ā、e、āya。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1227-2-8", "zh": "例如 sabbasmā、sabbasmiṃ、sabbassa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1227-9-14", "zh": "yasmā、yasmiṃ、yassa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1227-15-20", "zh": "tasmā、tasmiṃ、tassa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1227-21-26", "zh": "kasmā、kasmiṃ、kassa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1227-27-32", "zh": "imasmā、imasmiṃ、imassa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1228-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**sabbanāmehi**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1228-6-11", "zh": "例如 pāpā、pāpe、pāpāya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1229-2-4", "zh": "规则中用 ca 字，是为了牵引上一条规则的内容。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1230-2-9", "zh": "111,179. Ghato nādīnaṃ（在 gha 之后，nā 等语尾变为 āya）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1231-2-11", "zh": "在 gha 之后，nā 等单数各格语尾替换为 āya。", "confidence": 80}
